Implement user story epam-ts-005: Fix fetchWithRetry — attempts not reset between independent calls

## Story Description
The fetchWithRetry function in src/retry.ts uses a module-level attempts counter that is never reset. After one failed call exhausts the retry budget, subsequent calls immediately throw without making any attempts. Fix it so each call to fetchWithRetry gets its own independent attempt counter. The source file(s) are in /tmp/epam-bench-epam-ts-005-ia1Rm4/src/. Do not modify the test files.

